  {
   "kind": "text-images-slider",
   "id": "Special edition",
   "title": "Special edition",
   "intro": "​​\nA new addition has been made to the Flyer line this year, with the special PILOT EDITION, combining distinctive style with new features.\nThis special edition has exclusive features:\n- Grey hull\n- Elegant hull decoration\n- Special edition upholstery\n- Black pulpits\n- Cockpit LEDs (in trim)\n- Bolster seats\n- Bow Sunbathing\n- Foldable benchseats in cockpit",
   "items": [],
   "images": [
    "https://www.beneteau.com/sites/default/files/inline-images/logo-flyer-pilot-edition-petit.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "slider-design-pleasure",
   "id": "anchor_main-points",
   "title": "Optimized space",
   "intro": "Her lines are sharper, but that does not mean there is less space. The space on board allows for fittings and benches that will seat up to 9 people on board.",
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "Driving sensations",
     "text": "The Flyer 7 SPACEdecck offers a smooth ride and some very enjoyable driving sensations. The Flyer 7 SPACEdeck has the Air Step® 2 hull, which means that it lifts off fast and is much more stable even at full speed."
    },
    {
     "title": "Saloon",
     "text": "The forward saloon with facing seats opens up a large floor area, ideal for fishing.\nIt also provides safe access to the anchor locker."
    },
    {
     "title": "SUNBATHING",
     "text": "The large saloon converts to a sunbathing area to the bow."
    },
    {
     "title": "Cockpit",
     "text": "The cockpit saloon is surprisingly large.\nIt seats up to 6 people, thanks to the rotating bolster seats and the built-in side bench seats."
    }
   ],
